        "original_id": "d6b6b1a2-611e-51de-a436-8107f57995c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saw II: Flesh & Blood, Saw 3D, Saw IV\n- People: Kevin Greutert, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan, Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, Cary Elwes, Gabby West, Scott Patterson, Lyriq Bent\n- Shows: Scream Queens\n\nFacts:\n- Saw IV stars Tobin Bell, Scott Patterson, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, and Lyriq Bent.\n- In 2010, Saw II: Flesh & Blood was released to coincide with the release of Saw 3D one week later.\n- Saw 3D, also known as Saw: The Final Chapter and Saw VII, is a 2010 American 3D horror film directed by Kevin Greutert, written by Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan, and starring Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, and Cary Elwes.\n- Gabby West won a role in Saw 3D through a competition on the reality show Scream Queens.",
